#| --------------------------------------------------------------------------

                         kanata: Kinesis Advantage 2

   Active host: work. Bound to the Advantage 2 evdev node via `linux-dev'
   below; `kb_setup.sh' picks this file when $HOSTNAME == work.

   The `defsrc' layer below mirrors the Advantage 2's physical layout
   (single board + thumb clusters; no split). Copy a `deflayer' template
   to add a new layer with matching `transparent' buttons (`_').

(deflayer name
  _    _    _    _                             _    _    _    _    _    _    _
       _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _         _    _
  _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _         _
  _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _         _
  _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _
  _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _    _              _
